      "created_at": "2025-07-31T12:14:48.488Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My companies email id is on Google workspace. When i try to create our first email account on erpnext, its giving me the following error:</p>\n<p>Could not find Row <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#37:</span> Role: Course Creator, Row <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#47:</span> Role: Moderator</p>\n<p>I checked the list of roles, and i don’t see any course creator or moderator role there. I don’t know why its asking for the above. I am not able to create any email account due to this and is stuck. Kindly help.</p>\n<p>Thanks<br>\nRohit</p>",
