      "created_at": "2026-01-13T13:09:31.395Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Create the roles again manually:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Go to: <strong>Settings → Users and Permissions → Role</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Moderator</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Course Creator</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>",
